# Haunted Sweden brand

The product name is always **Haunted Sweden**.

Never write: Swedish Hauntings, Sweden Hauntings, Haunted Sweden App Project, Swedish Haunted Locations.

## Editorial database fields (JSON)

- `hauntedSwedenScore` — label: Haunted Sweden Score
- `suggestedHauntedSwedenTags` — label: Suggested Haunted Sweden Tags
- `hauntedSwedenAppSummary` — label: Haunted Sweden App Summary
- `whyItFitsHauntedSweden` — label: Why It Fits Haunted Sweden

All UI, SEO, descriptions, investigations, and articles use the **Haunted Sweden** brand.

See `docs/BRAND.md` and `lib/brand.ts`.
